  <name>Fugarius Wallpaper</name>
  <summary>Multi-monitor panorama wallpaper for KDE Plasma</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Place one image across all monitors as a single virtual desktop panorama.
      Per-monitor zoom, offset, and rotation; native apply on KDE Plasma Wayland
      via D-Bus, with optional swww support on other compositors.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">fugarius-wallpaper.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/lukasfuscic19/Fugarius-Wallpaper</url>
